      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/budgeting-cost-living/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Budgeting for Anne Arundel County&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;budgeting-for-anne-arundel-county&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#budgeting-for-anne-arundel-county&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 6 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Moving to Anne Arundel County means understanding the local costs. Some are obvious (rent or mortgage), but others sneak up on you (property taxes, utility seasonal variations). Here&amp;rsquo;s what&amp;rsquo;s known about budgeting for life in the county.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Housing Costs: The Big Ticket&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;housing-costs-the-big-ticket&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#housing-costs-the-big-ticket&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Housing is typically 30-40% of your budget, and Anne Arundel County runs above the national average.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
